@startuml A03-build-flow
!pragma layout smetana
title A03 构建与资源数据流（总体及 Linux 补充已确认）
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam componentBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
top to bottom direction

artifact ".uproject / Target.cs / Build.cs\n目标与依赖配置" as Rules
artifact "UE C++ 源码\n世界模拟 / 适配 / 反射声明" as Code
artifact "ExperimentCore 源码\n独立标准 C++20，无 UE 反射" as CoreSource
component "Ubuntu24.04 / GCC13 / CMake3.28 / CTest\n核心独立验证；无 UE include / PCH / Unity" as Isolated
artifact "地图 / Blueprint / Data Asset\n网格 / 材质 / UI 资产" as Content
artifact "运行时 .ini 配置" as RuntimeConfig
component "UBT 构建编排" as UBT
component "UHT 反射代码生成" as UHT
component "MSVC 14.38 + SDK 22621\n编译 / 链接" as Compiler
artifact "Editor / Game 目标二进制" as Binary
component "UAT BuildCookRun" as UAT
component "Cook\n准备 Win64 运行内容" as Cook
component "Stage / Package\n汇合代码与内容" as Package
artifact "Windows Development 原型包" as Build
component "游戏运行\nA01 / A02 流程" as Runtime
artifact "本地 JSON Lines 结果" as Logs

Rules --> UBT
Code --> UBT
CoreSource --> UBT : 同一份源码编入游戏模块
CoreSource --> Isolated : 验证引擎独立性
UBT --> UHT : 反射声明
UHT --> Compiler : 生成代码
UBT --> Compiler : C++ 源码与构建参数
Compiler --> Binary
UAT ..> UBT : 组织 Build
UAT ..> Cook : 组织 Cook
Content --> Cook
Binary --> Cook : 加载必要代码类型
Binary --> Package
Cook --> Package
RuntimeConfig --> Package : Stage 按规则收集
UAT ..> Package : 组织 Stage / Package
Package --> Build
Build --> Runtime
Runtime --> Logs

note right of Compiler
已确认版本，尚未完成构建验证。
本机已有14.44，需补齐所选14.38。
实际工具集路径以 UBT 输出核对。
end note
legend bottom
  Windows 已确认：UE 5.6.1 / VS2022 17.14 / C++20 / 引擎自带 .NET8。
  本图为架构设计，不表示工程、编译或打包已经完成。
endlegend
@enduml
